The exit, rehearsed or not
Two columns. On the left, an export somebody scopes when the relationship
ends: first run on the worst possible day, produced by the party being left,
and unverifiable against what was actually held. On the right, the archive
that already runs every night: backup and departure are the same path, the
archive is sealed to the owner's key rather than the host's, and it can be
verified without asking anybody.
